    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho uDavida esehlala endlini yakhe, wathi kuNathani umprofethi: Akuboneke, mina ngihlala endlini yemikusu, kodwa umtshokotsho wesivumelwano ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " uhlala ethenteni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16+2SA.7.17+2SA.7.18+2SA.7.19+2SA.7.20+2SA.7.21+2SA.7.22+2SA.7.23+2SA.7.24+2SA.7.25+2SA.7.26+2SA.7.27+2SA.7.28+2SA.7.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:1–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNathani wathi kuDavida: Yenza konke okusenhliziyweni yakho, ngoba uNkulunkulu ulawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa kwathi ngabona lobobusuku ilizwi leNkosi uNkulunkulu lafika kuNathani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lathi: Hamba uyetshela inceku yami uDavida ukuthi iNkosi ithi: Kawuyikungakhela indlu ukuba ngihlale kuyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba kangizanga ngihlale endlini kusukela osukwini engakhupha ngalo uIsrayeli kuze kube lamhla, kodwa ngahlala ethenteni ngihamba kundawo ngendawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaweni zonke engihambe kuzo labo bonke abakoIsrayeli ngake ngakhuluma ilizwi yini komunye wabahluleli bakoIsrayeli, engabalaya ukwalusa abantu bami ngathi: Yini lingangakhelanga indlu yemikusu na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke uzakutsho encekwini yami uDavida uthi: INkosi yamabandla ithi: Ngakuthatha ekwaluseni izimvu egangeni ukuba ube ngumbusi wabantu bami uIsrayeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngaba lawe lapho uya khona, ngachitha zonke izitha zakho ngaphambi kwakho; ngizakwenzela ibizo elikhulu phakathi kwabakhulu basemhlabeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizabamisela indawo abantu bami uIsrayeli, ngibagxumeke ukuba bahlale endaweni yabo, bangabe besakhathazwa futhi; labantu ababi kabasayikubacindezela futhi njengakuqala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kusukela esikhathini engamisa ngaso abahluleli ebantwini bami uIsrayeli; ngizakunqoba zonke izitha zakho, ngikwenze ube mkhulu, ngiqinise indlu yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi lapho insuku zakho seziphelile, usuyile kwabaphansi, ngimise omunye wabantwana bakho ukuba abe yinkosi esikhundleni sakho, ngiqinise umbuso wakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena uzakungakhela indlu, ngizakuqinisa umbuso wakhe kuze kube nininini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mina ngizakuba nguyise, yena abe yindodana yami; kangiyikususa uthando lwami olungapheliyo kuye njengoba ngalususa kulowo owayengaphambi kwakho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.6.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 6:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 1:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodwa ngizamqinisa yena endlini yami lasembusweni wami kuze kube nininini, lombuso wakhe uzakuma kokuphela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNathani wamtshela uDavida konke lokho ayekutsheliwe, lakho konke ayekutshengisiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uDavida yasingena ihlala phambi kweNkosi, yathi: Kambe mina ngingubani, Nkosi Nkulunkulu, lendlu yami iyini, ukuze ungifikise lapha na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanti lokhu kuyinto encinyane nje emehlweni akho, Nkulunkulu; usukhulumile futhi ngendlu yenceku yakho ngokwesikhathi esikhatshana esizayo, wangitshengisa lezizukulwana ezizayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phoke, mina nginguDavida nje ngigabe ngisathini kuwe ngodumo olunike inceku yakho na? Ngoba uyayazi inceku yakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngenxa yenceku yakho, Nkosi, langokwenhliziyo yakho wenzile konke lokhu okukhulu ukuba uveze zonke lezizinto ezinkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakho onjengawe, Nkosi, kakho uNkulunkulu ngaphandle kwakho, ngakho konke esikuzwileyo ngendlebe zethu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisiphi isizwe emhlabeni esinjengabantu bakho uIsrayeli, Nkulunkulu, owazihlengela bona babe ngabantu bakho, wazenzela udumo ngezenzo ezinkulu lezesabekayo ngokuxotsha izizwe ngaphambi kwabantu bakho owabahlenga eGibithe na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wazimisela abantu bakho uIsrayeli ukuba babe ngabakho kuze kube nini lanini: wena Nkosi, waba nguNkulunkulu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khathesike, Nkosi, akuqinise ilizwi owalikhuluma ngenceku yakho langendlu yayo kuze kube nininini, wenze njengokukhuluma kwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibizo lakho kaliqiniswe libe likhulu kuze kube nininini, ukuba abantu bathi: INkosi yamabandla inguNkulunkulu kaIsrayeli, nguNkulunkulu koIsrayeli. Lendlu yenceku yakho uDavida izamiswa phambi kwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba wena, Nkulunkulu wami, uyambulele inceku yakho ukuthi uzamisa indlu yayo; ngakho inceku yakho ilesibindi sokukhuleka phambi kwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yebo, Nkosi, wena unguNkulunkulu, uyithembisile inceku yakho lokho okuhle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke akuyibusise indlu yenceku yakho ukuze ibe phambi kwakho kuze kube nininini; ngoba, wena Nkosi, lokho okubusisayo kubusisiwe kuze kube nini lanini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.17.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
